From fb0654966960c004bae8de1a239101c22840244b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anass EREKYSY <ereanass@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:23:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(design): new layout with subtle motion

- Header: transparent until scroll, active-section pill, FR/EN switch, mobile menu
- Hero: staggered entrance, photo card with location tag, animated stat counters
- Projects: Plumb and Cockpit as large featured cards, others in a 3-column grid with hover zoom, animated detail panel
- Experience: tabbed layout (sticky role list + detail panel)
- What I do, skills, how I work, education rebuilt as cards; process as a stepper with an animated connector
- Contact: split card with dark pitch panel and form
- Scroll reveal directive, respects prefers-reduced-motion
- Same content, colors and typography
